    "mermaidDiagram": "```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    A[Node.js app starts or hits DB code path] --> B[Resolve DB config host/port]\n    B --> C[Target = 127.0.0.1:5432]\n    C --> D[Node net module opens TCP connection]\n    D --> E{Is something listening on 127.0.0.1:5432?}\n\n    E -->|Yes| F[PostgreSQL accepts TCP connection]\n    F --> G[DB session established]\n    G --> H[App continues normally]\n\n    E -->|No| I[Connection refused during socket connect]\n    I --> J[Error thrown: ECONNREFUSED 127.0.0.1:5432]\n    J --> K[DB-dependent startup/request fails]\n\n    L[Possible divergence causes:\\n- Postgres not running\\n- Wrong host/port config\\n- Container localhost mismatch\\n- DB bound elsewhere\\n- Startup race] --> E\n\n    style A fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:1px\n    style B fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:1px\n    style C fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:1px\n    style D fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:1px\n    style F fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:1px\n    style G fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:1px\n    style H fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:1px\n\n    style E fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#ef6c00,stroke-width:2px\n    style L fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#ef6c00,stroke-width:2px\n\n    style I fill:#ffebee,stroke:#c62828,stroke-width:2px\n    style J fill:#ffebee,stroke:#c62828,stroke-width:2px\n    style K fill:#ffebee,stroke:#c62828,stroke-width:2px\n```",
    "clarifyingQuestions": "1. From the exact runtime environment where the Node.js process runs, what do `ss -ltnp | grep 5432` or `lsof -iTCP:5432 -sTCP:LISTEN` show?\n2. What resolved DB connection settings does the app log at startup after env/config parsing—specifically host, port, and whether it is using TCP vs Unix socket?\n3. Is the Node.js process running on bare metal, Docker, WSL, devcontainer, or CI, and if isolated, where is PostgreSQL actually running relative to that environment?\n4. If you run `pg_isready -h 127.0.0.1 -p 5432` from the same environment immediately before starting the app, does it report accepting connections or no response/refused?\n5. Does the failure happen consistently or only during startup, and if you retry the app or DB connection 5–10 seconds later, does it succeed?",
