    "mermaidDiagram": "```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    A[Admin logs in] --> B[App shows session timeout configured as 24 hours]\n    B --> C[Auth/session artifacts issued<br/>cookie / server session / token]\n    C --> D[Admin uses app or remains logged in]\n\n    D --> E{Is runtime auth/session layer<br/>actually aligned to 24h?}\n\n    E -->|Yes| F[Session remains valid beyond 15 minutes]\n    F --> G[Admin continues working normally]\n    G --> H[Expected logout only near configured 24h or true policy limit]\n\n    E -->|No - divergence| I[Separate layer / admin policy / idle refresh failure / fallback default applies ~15m]\n    I --> J[Session or token expires around 15 minutes]\n    J --> K[Next page load / API call checks auth state]\n    K --> L[Admin is logged out / redirected to login / session expired]\n\n    classDef happy fill:#d1fae5,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px,color:#111827;\n    classDef bug fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#dc2626,stroke-width:2px,color:#111827;\n    classDef diverge fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,stroke-width:2px,color:#111827;\n\n    class A,B,C,D,F,G,H happy;\n    class I diverge;\n    class J,K,L bug;\n```",
    "clarifyingQuestions": "1. For an affected admin login, what is the exact expiry/TTL on the issued session cookie or JWT immediately after login, and does it show roughly 15 minutes or 24 hours?\n2. Does the same behavior occur for a non-admin user in the same environment, using the same browser and same login method, or is the 15-minute logout isolated to admins only?\n3. During the 15-minute window, do authenticated admin API requests extend the server-side session TTL, or does the TTL remain fixed from initial login even while the user is active?\n4. Are admin routes authenticated through a different guard, cookie, middleware chain, or SSO policy than standard users, and if so, what timeout is configured there?\n5. At the exact logout timestamp, what do the application logs and any upstream IdP/proxy/auth-gateway logs report: app session expiry, token expiry, idle timeout, policy enforcement, or loss of upstream authentication?",
